      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Transparency is the cornerstone of our car transport service, ensuring that every client understands exactly what they are paying for and why. We have engineered our pricing model to eliminate ambiguity, fostering trust through clear communication and rigid adherence to ethical billing practices.</p>
<p>By removing hidden costs and standardizing our documentation, we empower you to manage your logistics with confidence, knowing that your financial obligations are fixed from the moment of booking.</p>

<p>Our commitment to fair pricing begins with the absolute elimination of moving-day surcharges. Unlike many competitors who inflate costs at the last minute due to dynamic demand or logistical hurdles, our rates are static once confirmed. You will never face unexpected fees for weather delays, traffic congestion, or temporary route changes.</p>
<p>The price you agree upon during the initial quote is the price you pay, regardless of external variables on the day of transport. This policy ensures budgetary stability and prevents the stress of last-minute financial surprises, allowing you to focus solely on the safe arrival of your vehicle.</p>

<p>To further solidify this trust, we provide itemized binding contracts for every transaction. These contracts are not vague estimates but legally enforceable agreements that detail every single component of the service cost. Each line item, from base transportation fees to specific handling requirements, is explicitly listed and agreed upon before any work begins.</p>
<p>This granularity ensures that there are no "gray areas" where costs could be manipulated or obscured. You receive a document that serves as both a service agreement and a definitive price list, protecting you from scope creep or unauthorized additions to your bill.</p>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Finally, we ensure that all final invoices are IBA-approved bills, specifically formatted to facilitate seamless insurance claims if necessary.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Should any incident occur during transit, our billing documents meet the rigorous standards required by independent insurance adjusters and major underwriters.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This includes detailed timestamps, geolocation data, and clear service descriptions that align with industry compliance norms.</span></li></ul>
<p>By providing these pre-approved, standardized bills, we remove the bureaucratic friction often associated with filing claims, ensuring that your recovery process is swift and hassle-free. Our pricing structure is designed not just for clarity, but for long-term security, giving you the assurance that your investment is protected at every step.</p></div>
